WEBVTT

00:00:29.873 --> 00:00:31.679
Ninafikiri kwa namna ya picha.

00:00:32.393 --> 00:00:34.642
Ninafikiri kwa picha, sio maneno.

00:00:35.174 --> 00:00:39.405
Kwangu mimi, maneno ni kama
lugha na hisia.

00:00:39.993 --> 00:00:41.745
Kuna watu wengi kama mimi;

00:00:41.769 --> 00:00:44.283
Nikola Tesla, kwa mfano,

00:00:44.307 --> 00:00:49.322
ambaye anaweza kuona, kubuni,
kupima na kutafuta suluhu kila kitu --

00:00:49.346 --> 00:00:52.752
uvumbuzi wake wote --
katika akili yake, kwa ufasaha.

00:00:54.633 --> 00:00:57.975
Lugha ni kitu ambacho hakipo
katika aina yetu, hata hivyo.

00:00:57.999 --> 00:01:00.109
mimi ni mshamba kidogo,